 # 7\. Functional Modules

 ## 7.1 Authentication Module

 Provides:

 - Registration
- Login
- Logout
- User authentication
- Session management

 ## 7.2 AI Tutor Module

 Allows students to ask academic questions and receive AI-generated explanations.

 Example:

```
Student:
Explain photosynthesis in simple terms.

        ↓

EduGenie + Gemini

        ↓

Student-friendly explanation
```

 ## 7.3 Summarization Module

 Processes study material and produces:

 - Summary
- Important points
- Key concepts
- Key terms

 ## 7.4 Quiz Generator

 Generates questions based on:

 - Subject
- Topic
- Difficulty
- Number of questions

 ## 7.5 Answer Evaluation

 Evaluates student responses and provides:

 - Score
- Correct/incorrect information
- Explanations
- Feedback

 ## 7.6 Learning History

 Stores relevant student activity such as:

 - Questions
- AI responses
- Quiz attempts
- Scores
- Topics

 ## 7.7 Progress Tracking

 Displays learning statistics and activity.

 Example:

```
Topics Studied      : 15
Quizzes Completed   : 10
Average Score       : 82%
Questions Asked     : 45
```

