 # 10\. Gemini Integration

 The Gemini API is integrated through the backend.

```
Student Question
       ↓
Frontend
       ↓
Backend
       ↓
Prompt Construction
       ↓
Gemini API
       ↓
AI Response
       ↓
Backend
       ↓
Frontend
       ↓
Student
```

 The Gemini API credential should be stored securely on the server and should not be exposed in client-side code.

